                                                "sense_id": "e2781400-10c0-3bc0-b4ad-f9fd3cb4132e",
                                                "text": "The referee seemed well placed to award the goal, but video evidence suggested the protests were well founded and the incident only strengthens the case of those lobbying for technology to assist officials."
                                            }
